+## Operations
 
 ### Monitoring & Alerting
-- Key metrics:
-  - API: P50/P99 latency, error rates, rate-limit drops
-  - Event Store: write conflicts, txn latency, replication lag
-  - Bus/Workers: consumer lag, DLQ rate, expansion CPU/time per event
-  - Derived: `computed_at age`, cache hit rate, bucket read latency
-- Alerts:
-  - Read SLO burn (99.99%) and write SLO burn (99.9%)
-  - Worker lag > 2 minutes sustained; `computed_at age` > 10 minutes for top N calendars
-  - Spike in RRULE validation errors (client regressions)
 
-### Deployment Strategy
-- Blue/green or canary for API/Calendar Service with feature flags for recurrence parsing changes.
